# Runtime-only direct dependencies of the production backend (N-08, ADR-027).
#
# Source of truth for requirements-prod.lock. Keep the pins identical to the
# runtime lines of requirements.txt (a test enforces it); requirements.txt
# additionally carries the test-only packages (pytest, httpx) that must never
# reach a production release.
#
# Regenerate (Python 3.14, the production interpreter; pip==26.2.1,
# pip-tools==7.6.1, as release-ci does) with:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --no-emit-index-url --strip-extras \
#       --pip-args="--only-binary=:all:" \
#       --output-file=requirements-prod.lock requirements-prod.in
# pip-compile keeps the existing pins; changing a version is a separate,
# reviewed change (docs/DEPLOYMENT.md section 6).
